    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Campbells Auctioneers are delighted to present this spacious detached residence to the open market, occupying an elevated site in the highly sought-after coastal townland of Braade, Kincasslagh\n\nEnjoying a commanding position, the property boasts stunning sea views across the surrounding coastline while benefiting from a peaceful setting just a short distance from the villages of Kincasslagh and Annagry, and within easy reach of a wide range of local amenities. \n\nCarrickfinn Blue Flag Beach, Donegal Airport are close by, making this an exceptional location for both permanent living and holiday use.\n\nExtending over two floors, the property offers bright, spacious and well-proportioned accommodation throughout. A modern open-plan layout allows an abundance of natural light to flow through the home.\n\nThe ground floor comprises an entrance porch, open-plan kitchen / living room, dining / sun room, utility room, W.C., and a generous master bedroom complete with en-suite.\n\nThe first floor provides two further well proportioned bedrooms, a family bathroom, hot press and landing, offering comfortable and versatile accommodation for family living or visiting guests.\n\nExternally, the property is complemented by surrounding gardens and a detached shed, providing excellent additional storage while making the most of its elevated position and spectacular coastal outlook.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and is by STRICT appointment only with Campbells Auctioneers.\n\nOur Ref: K1289."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch - 1.12m (3'8\") x 1.02m (3'4\")\nTiled\n\nKitchen / Living Room - 8m (26'3\") x 5.27m (17'3\")\nOpen Plan, Fully Fitted Units, Wood Pellet Stove, Laminate Wooden Floor, Tiled Splashback\n\nDining / Sun Room - 4.24m (13'11\") x 3.74m (12'3\")\nLaminate Wooden Floor\n\nUtility Room - 2.26m (7'5\") x 1.96m (6'5\")\nTiled, Fitted Units\n\nW.C - 1.9m (6'3\") x 1.17m (3'10\")\nTiled Floor, Hand Basin, Toilet\n\nMaster Bedroom (En Suite) - 3.99m (13'1\") x 3.96m (13'0\")\nCarpeted, Fitted Wardrobe\n\nEn Suite - 2.55m (8'4\") x 1.92m (6'4\")\nTiled Floor half Wall, Shower, Hand Basin, Toilet\n\nBedroom 2 - 5.55m (18'3\") x 3.59m (11'9\")\nCarpeted\n\nLanding - 2.71m (8'11\") x 1.35m (4'5\")\nCarpeted\n\nHot Press - 1.59m (5'3\") x 1.39m (4'7\")\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.99m (13'1\") x 3.2m (10'6\")\nCarpeted\n\nBathroom - 3.98m (13'1\") x 2.21m (7'3\")\nTiled Floor & Half wall, Bath, Shower, Hand Basin\n\nShed - 3.5m (11'6\") x 2.49m (8'2\")\nExtra Storage Space, Boiler, Small Roller Door\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
